{"3280680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flower For A Farewell", "steam_appid": 3280680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game is a visual novel/scroller adventure telling the story of Toby. <br>Toby is a turtle who is well on in his years and has seen much. <br>He ventures out into the woods behind his home, where he and his wife always used to go on walks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our story focuses  on a complex topic: loss and grief. <br>It reminds us that not all journeys are the same; in some, you may only be able to lend an ear, and in some, you can help calm their worries. <br>But, regardless, you have to keep moving forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Toby continues, he will encounter multiple woodland creatures in the forest. Each character, along the way, represents a different stage of grief. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you talk with them, you collect a flower from each one. You will learn more about their dilemmas while also learning about Toby's mental journey.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game is a visual novel/scroller adventure telling the story of Toby. <br>Toby is a turtle who is well on in his years and has seen much. <br>He ventures out into the woods behind his home, where he and his wife always used to go on walks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our story focuses  on a complex topic: loss and grief. <br>It reminds us that not all journeys are the same; in some, you may only be able to lend an ear, and in some, you can help calm their worries. <br>But, regardless, you have to keep moving forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Toby continues, he will encounter multiple woodland creatures in the forest. Each character, along the way, represents a different stage of grief. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you talk with them, you collect a flower from each one. You will learn more about their dilemmas while also learning about Toby's mental journey.</p>", "short_description": "Flower For A Farewell is a visual novel, Scroller-Adventure, that takes you on a journey with a turtle named Toby, who is going through grief. Meet characters who are dealing with a similar painful experience.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280680/header.jpg?t=1733527306", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280680/c6f3ee41c7f86d4a2b7c4abfa3a40db1f1c46af5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1733527306", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280680/c6f3ee41c7f86d4a2b7c4abfa3a40db1f1c46af5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1733527306", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo E6750 (2 * 2660) or equivalent / AMD Athlon 64 X2 Dual Core 5000+ (2 * 2600) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GT 430 (1024 MB) / Radeon HD 5570 (1024 MB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["AppleJamStudios"], "publishers": ["AppleJamStudios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 299, "final": 299, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$2.99"}, "packages": [1162202], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Flower For A Farewell", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1162202, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Flower For A Farewell - $2.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_fr